sections.text:
Clay body:    Iron-rich clay;    Gray/brown clay;  Kaolin + feldspar
              red/orange/buff    buff/tan/speckle  + quartz/silica;
              after firing                         pure white

Porosity:     Porous (must       Low porosity;     Non-porous;
              be glazed for      semi-vitrified    fully vitrified
              liquid use)        (vitrified)       translucent thin

Cobalt (Co)  Blue (all ranges)     Blue (stable)        Strongest colorant;
 CoO         0.2% = strong blue    not atmosphere-      0.5% = vivid blue
             2-5% = deep/black     sensitive            Very stable
